	(descr "JXTCONN CSIM-H137-7P-class nano-SIM push-push socket, H=1.37mm, 7 pads (5 ISO7816 SIM signal contacts VCC/RST/CLK/GND/IO + 2-pin mechanical card-detect switch CD1/CD2). JXTCONN's own dimensioned drawing could not be retrieved; pad grid is based on the real ATTEND 115U-A103 nano-SIM push-push drawing (https://www.attend.com.tw/en/data/download/file/115U-A103_B_2.pdf), a mechanically-equivalent commodity part in the same 1.4mm-class height. See the Description property for full disclosure -- this needs confirmation against a physical part or a genuine JXTCONN drawing before layout lock.")
